8 11-35-42 (0-25-18-39).png", "id": "861151629617134", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_861151632950467_1575565934216625427_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XriJJBqpmYUQ7kNvwFLHwk7&_nc_oc=AdqpGN8ZPggG2aMPCX-Y2XMi1fh6djdzZ_vxy-64TeEjjjZn4SjUf0xq10oGE9hiFr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOG_o1_iPc0nad83ArFhO5bwuVq49Rg8UvaHEMChMX8Wg&oe=6ACCE6C7"}, {"file_name": "DoD2 2024-05-28 11-35-42 (0-31-27-00).png", "id": "2213675815780096", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820428_2213675819113429_2339079547917946445_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n1ef6uXf_v4Q7kNvwEcGI-_&_nc_oc=AdpwR-f6DUBTcxPjoeojnrdhVG7ZmTOsqxJNJYCFoKas4Y0N2zXdVEVvRynhT1VKxOU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNaxa3F649YMRZ6n81oM2hTsZux1FHhXYoq2Si_qpQb2g&oe=6ACD0C7E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "DoD_Key_ART_for_Meta.png", "id": "1548928505912944", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982620_1548928515912943_1441057688188324508_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WRF82QRhr0MQ7kNvwETBV0x&_nc_oc=AdoP5Ta7unWrQew8jlA_S5EHCZ2p8NMvqhtU95a24ZzuXFy4a3SfmexmmHRHyVki0e4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNzcmokSNCeh98rcfeFa1cmYBeI-DiXwJlIpllq8ytaxQ&oe=6ACD0494"}, "display_name": "Drunk Or Dead 2", "keywords": ["arcadeshooter", "zombievr", "vraction", "fastpaced", "shootinggame"], "long_description": "markdown\n## DRUNK OR DEAD 2: THE FIRST STORY\nEvery survivor has a story. This is the first one.\n\nThe world has changed forever. Cities are empty. The streets belong to the infected. Every trip beyond the safety of your shelter could be your last.\n\n{967077976445818}\n\nAfter her safe haven is destroyed, Triss is forced to find a new home\u2014and new allies. Together, you'll set out on a dangerous journey to find the mysterious Preacher. But the road to him is far more hazardous than expected. \n\nGulp down volatile survival serums to trigger unpredictable combat enhancements. Fight through zombie hordes and face deadly Neuro Zombies\u2014former soldiers who still remember how to use their firearms under pressure. Drive improvised vehicles, use the environment, and fight alongside other survivors. \n\nDrunk Or Dead 2: The First Story is a standalone, complete episodic VR adventure.\n\n## FEATURES:\n* **Story-Driven VR Campaign:** A complete story with its own beginning, journey, and ending.\n* **Visceral Combat:** Aim, manual-reload, and balance the risky side effects of experimental serums.\n* **Smart Undead:** Face dangerous Neuro Zombies who use cover and shoot back.\n* **Vehicles & Interactivity:** Drive improvised vehicles to crush the horde.\n* **Maximum VR Comfort (NEW):** Full support for both Standing and Seated Modes with custom height calibration.\n* **Multiplayer Social Hub:** Relax and connect with other survivors.\n\nOne story. One journey. One team.\n", "short_description": "Drunk Or Dead 2: The First Story is a story-driven VR zombie adventure. A brutal plague wiped out civilization. To survive, you must rely on volatile liquid serums that grant unpredictable, mind-bending combat enhancements. Fight through intense zombie hordes, face dangerous Neuro Zombies armed with firearms, drive improvised vehicles, and build a team from a group of strangers. Experience a complete episodic campaign built for true VR action. Will you handle the side effects?"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2577412176099545", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Drunk Or Dead 2", "keywords": ["jogodezumbi", "tirovr", "jogodetiro", "vra\u00e7\u00e3o", "sobrevivencia"], "long_description": "## DRUNK OR DEAD 2: THE FIRST STORY\nCada sobrevivente tem uma hist\u00f3ria. Esta \u00e9 a primeira.\n\nO mundo mudou para sempre. As cidades est\u00e3o vazias. As ruas pertencem aos infectados. Cada jornada al\u00e9m da seguran\u00e7a do seu abrigo pode ser a \u00faltima.\n\n{1689606069453364}\n\nAp\u00f3s seu ref\u00fagio ser destru\u00eddo, Triss \u00e9 for\u00e7ada a encontrar um novo lar e novos aliados. Juntos, voc\u00eas partir\u00e3o em uma viagem perigosa para encontrar o misterioso Pregador. Mas o caminho at\u00e9 ele \u00e9 muito mais arriscado do que o esperado.\n\nUse soros de sobreviv\u00eancia vol\u00e1teis para ativar melhorias de combate imprevis\u00edveis. Enfr\u00eante hordas de zumbis e Neuro Zumbis mortais \u2014 ex-soldados que ainda lembram como usar armas de fogo sob press\u00e3o. Dirija ve\u00edculos improvisados, use o ambiente e lute ao lado de outros sobreviventes.\n\nDrunk Or Dead 2: The First Story \u00e9 uma aventura epis\u00f3dica em VR completa e independente.\n\n## RECURSOS:\n* **Campanha em VR Focada na Hist\u00f3ria:** Uma narrativa completa com in\u00edcio, meio e fim pr\u00f3prios.\n* **Combate Visceral:** Mire, recarregue manualmente e equilibre os efeitos colaterais arriscados dos soros experimentais.\n* **Mortos-Vivos Inteligentes:** Enfrente Neuro Zumbis perigosos que usam cobertura e revidam com armas.\n* **Ve\u00edculos e Interatividade:** Assuma o volante de ve\u00edculos improvisados para esmagar a horda.\n* **Conforto M\u00e1ximo em VR (NOVO):** Jogue do seu jeito! Suporte total para os modos Em P\u00e9 e Sentado (Seated Mode) com calibra\u00e7\u00e3o de altura personalizada.\n\nUma hist\u00f3ria. Uma jornada. Uma equipe.\n", "short_description": "Drunk Or Dead 2: The First Story \u00e9 uma aventura de a\u00e7\u00e3o em VR contra zumbis com foco na hist\u00f3ria. Uma praga brutal destruiu o mundo. Para sobreviver, use soros l\u00edquidos vol\u00e1teis que concedem melhorias de combate imprevis\u00edveis. Enfrente hordas intensas de zumbis, lute contra Neuro Zumbis armados, dirija ve\u00edculos improvisados e transforme um grupo de estranhos em uma equipe. Viva uma campanha epis\u00f3dica completa feita para pura a\u00e7\u00e3o em VR. Voc\u00ea aguentar\u00e1 os efeitos colaterais?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://4ilab.io/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://4ilab.io/terms", "publisher_name": "4 I LAB LTD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://4ilab.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN", "pt_BR", "de", "ru", "fr", "it", "ja", "ko", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29095878980029833"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_1545474289901595_1265532340316018837_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QvcDVEZaI1MQ7kNvwGBsmqH&_nc_oc=AdqdUML_5eEoaSGu3NcSm5jNDipFWN6nUpnGhu7T6UiJzugvZ69hMCFYJkNsKJPWdmk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMeb0rfVi3n2kXKk1lOUOPBFNbbxvewyBRTYfIHhi2btw&oe=6ACCE1BA"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Drunk Or Dead 2", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Narrative", "id": "1008279844328894"}, {"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_na